[{"form_id":"0x00091F|narrative gameplay consistent dialogue tweaks.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"君はまだ、自分自身を証明する必要があるぞ、友よ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000920|narrative gameplay consistent dialogue tweaks.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"アエラがこの旅ではあなたの盾の兄弟となる、友よ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000921|narrative gameplay consistent dialogue tweaks.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"この冒険ではファルカスがあなたの盾の兄弟となる、友よ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000922|narrative gameplay consistent dialogue tweaks.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"言っただろう、これがヴィルカスの話していたものだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000923|narrative gameplay consistent dialogue tweaks.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"落ち着けよ、友よ。俺たちのために見せびらかす必要はないんだぜ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000924|narrative gameplay consistent dialogue tweaks.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"お前はそのことを知っているべきじゃない。まだ正式な同胞団員ではないことを忘れるな。身の程をわきまえろ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000F6C|narrative gameplay consistent dialogue tweaks.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"戻ろう。"},{"form_id":"0x000F6E|narrative gameplay consistent dialogue tweaks.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"あのドラゴンを殺しに行こう！"},{"form_id":"0x000F6F|narrative gameplay consistent dialogue tweaks.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"あのドラゴンを殺しに行こう！"},{"form_id":"0x000F70|narrative gameplay consistent dialogue tweaks.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"首長がドラゴン討伐の賞金をかけたぞ！どうする？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000F71|narrative gameplay consistent dialogue tweaks.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ドラゴンが集落を襲っているらしいぞ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000F71|narrative gameplay consistent dialogue tweaks.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"これで終わりにしよう。どうだ？","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000F7A|narrative gameplay consistent dialogue tweaks.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"まあ、それは筋が通るな。俺は戦士じゃないからな。"},{"form_id":"0x000F7B|narrative gameplay consistent dialogue tweaks.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"私は戦士じゃない。巨人と関わるつもりはない。"},{"form_id":"0x000F72|narrative gameplay consistent dialogue tweaks.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"お前は弱く、哀れだ。出て行け！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000F7C|narrative gameplay consistent dialogue tweaks.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"あら、失礼！私にはもっと大事な用事があるの。"},{"form_id":"0x000F73|narrative gameplay consistent dialogue tweaks.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ふん。バカめ！ お前とは話すことは何もない！ さっさと行け！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000F7D|narrative gameplay consistent dialogue tweaks.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"ありがとう。君もなかなかだな。"},{"form_id":"0x000F74|narrative gameplay consistent dialogue tweaks.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"イスグラモルの斧に誓って！ 気に入ったぞ。お前は恐るべき同胞団員になるだろう。","index":1}]